r:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      icon </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> icon</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;arrow-down&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      color </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;olive&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Run the shiny app</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui_s</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Run the shinydashboard app</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui_db</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div>"
